Hi Pieter,
My impression, from looking at the small write up on Ken's web page, is that the cdf you have is just a binary version of the (ASCII) cdf provided by Affymetrix -- i.e. no transcript cluster definitions so each unit is just a probeset/exon definition. Does that seem consistent with the mouse exon array (I have only done human...). Ken could answer better if he sees this email. I don't know if there are cdfs yet for the mouse exon array that give gene clustering. (I may shortly be analyzing such data, so I may have to create one if there is not one...)
Best,
Elizabeth

